    headed "NG Police Officer O.C.C.", lower bounds stored. The stats block on
    printed 84 is headed "Ishpeming Police O.C.C. Stats" and its abilities
    "Special Abilities of the Ishpeming Police Officer O.C.C."; the chart''s
    name is stored.
  - men_of_arms and occ_group: the book prints no O.C.C. grouping; its section
    heading is "Northern Gun O.C.C.s". Read as men of arms, as production''s
    NGR Police Officer and the NG Loss Prevention Officer are.
  - Area of Specialty (special ability 1) is four variants, one per specialty,
    each adding its specialty skills. Crisis Response Officer''s +2D6 S.D.C. is
    a variant bonus; its +1 attack applies only when firing a gun the whole
    melee round and is prose. Highway Patrol''s +10% to Pilot: Hovercycles,
    Skycycles & Rocket Bikes is a skill override on top of the O.C.C.''s +5%
    (70 + 5 + 10 = 85); its other bonuses apply only on a cycle or to spotting
    crime and are prose.
  - Psionics Among Investigators is prose: it applies to one variant, and a
    variant cannot carry a psionics block.
  - "Surveillance/Tailing" (Investigator +15%, Undercover Agent +10%) is read
    as the catalog''s Surveillance; Highway Patrol''s Tailing is its own line.
  - O.C.C. Related Skills prints "select four two additional skills at levels
    3, 6, 9 and 12". Read as four at level one and two more at each of levels
    3, 6, 9 and 12, the shape of the book''s other O.C.C.s with "two" for
    "one". The other readings: two at level one and two at each later level;
    or none at level one beyond the specialty and two (or four) at each later
    level.
  - Cowboy: None and Domestic: None, so not listed. Electrical "Basic only"
    and Mechanical "Basic only" are Basic Electronics and Basic Mechanics.
  - Hand to Hand: Expert, changed to Martial Arts for one O.C.C. Related
    Skill; the book offers no Assassin.
  - Stored equipment: two M.D.C. handcuffs, pocket computer, laser distancer
    and 8 E-Clips (4 each for the energy rifle and pistol). The NG 122-EXO
    Light Police Power Armor and the Police NG Interceptor Rocket Bike are
    vehicles rows, not gear; they and everything else issued are in the body.
  - starting_money is the 2D4x1,000 credits the book prints; salary is prose.
  - Skill bases are catalog base plus the printed bonus, already added.
